{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new sensation in jumping action soaring through the sky!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air Master Hanemaru is a jump action game where you control Hanemaru, a creature with small wings, using jumps and glides to avoid falling and reach the goal! With unique controls and a high difficulty level, various stages with changing atmospheres await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/c92818c686fafd35a54a367334ed8aeb.poster.avif?t=1753404827\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/c92818c686fafd35a54a367334ed8aeb.webm?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/c92818c686fafd35a54a367334ed8aeb.mp4?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you press the button during a jump, Hanemaru flaps its wings and can slightly ascend! If used at the right time, it can help you barely reach platforms or adjust your height, making it an essential action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/3a38096de6503afe4fe14333c58ed033.poster.avif?t=1753404827\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/3a38096de6503afe4fe14333c58ed033.webm?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/3a38096de6503afe4fe14333c58ed033.mp4?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Glide\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gliding slows your fall speed and allows you to move to distant platforms! It\u2019s especially useful for moving from high places or performing long-distance jumps! You can also fly faster by angling your glide, expanding your movement range significantly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/491d30538edda64b12a6973bb5443635.poster.avif?t=1753404827\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/491d30538edda64b12a6973bb5443635.webm?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/491d30538edda64b12a6973bb5443635.mp4?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Jump</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you time your jump perfectly while landing on a platform, the &quot;Just Jump&quot; activates! If you execute it well, you\u2019ll be able to jump higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/cbec93895c3b265424ca0b0d3375df46.poster.avif?t=1753404827\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/cbec93895c3b265424ca0b0d3375df46.webm?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/cbec93895c3b265424ca0b0d3375df46.mp4?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Checkpoint</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each stage, a large door awaits! Opening the door starts the next stage! If you make a mistake, you can retry from the checkpoint as long as you have remaining lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/c199ca2018103c5b5f1f48b67c0e7b12.poster.avif?t=1753404827\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/c199ca2018103c5b5f1f48b67c0e7b12.webm?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397780/extras/c199ca2018103c5b5f1f48b67c0e7b12.mp4?t=1753404827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Video &amp; Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be freely streamed on platforms like YouTube or Twitch. There are no restrictions on monetization. No prior or post-notification is needed.<br>There are no special restrictions on posting on social media.<br>If you include the game name and Steam page URL while streaming or posting videos, it would be appreciated!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Air Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3397780/f64d6b25b8e393854656dfb28b1d1ddb26d5991b.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 1 Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3397780/c2da2dfb5dbe9b93ca97b27a91a1278b9102a7dc.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 2 Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3397780/a5a567cdb989552f6d7eb2236b5913addeb02b7f.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 3 Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3397780/b71bc8feb59830c8361a228c63329925e17a3964.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 4 Clear!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3397780/6e732a2044074f38ffbb2fbfaf0